<title>USA: Madison promotes Joe Assad to president.</title>
<headline>Madison promotes Joe Assad to president.</headline>
<dateline>CORONADO, Calif. 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Madison Sports &amp; Entertainment Group Inc Wednesday said it has promoted Joe Assad from senior vice president to president.</p>
<p>The company was not available to say who Assad replaced as president.</p>
<p>In addition to his new duties and responsibilities, Assad will continue to oversee all sales and marketing activities for the company, they said.</p>
<p>Assad has also accepted a seat on the board of directors, it said.</p>
</text>
